          "docs": "<p>Cancels a scheduled key deletion during the waiting period. Use this operation to restore a <code>Key</code> that is scheduled for deletion.</p> <p>During the waiting period, the <code>KeyState</code> is <code>DELETE_PENDING</code> and <code>deletePendingTimestamp</code> contains the date and time after which the <code>Key</code> will be deleted. After <code>Key</code> is restored, the <code>KeyState</code> is <code>CREATE_COMPLETE</code>, and the value for <code>deletePendingTimestamp</code>"
        }
